      "payload": "{\"messages\":[{\"content\":[{\"id\":\"client:c_3002\",\"text\":\"<client id=\\\"client:c_3002\\\">\\nClient Kwame Asante (c_3002): self-directed mandate, growth risk tier, KYC verified, country GB.\\n</client>\\n\"},{\"id\":\"ledger:acct_7702\",\"text\":\"<account id=\\\"ledger:acct_7702\\\">\\nLedger for the account as of 2026-10-06T08:30:00Z: cash 3100.00 GBP. Positions: ACME (Acme Industrial plc): 1000 units settled, average cost 40.75; NIMB (Nimbus Data): 80 units settled, average cost 215.00.\\n</account>\\n\"},{\"id\":\"risk:s_c3_04\",\"text\":\"<account id=\\\"risk:s_c3_04\\\">\\nRisk screen for this session: low. No signals.\\n</account>\\n\"},{\"id\":\"contract:portfolio\",\"text\":\"<format id=\\\"contract:portfolio\\\">\\nReply as JSON with exactly these keys: \\\"answer\\\" (plain text, at most 150 words), \\\"figures\\\" (a list of {\\\"symbol\\\", \\\"units\\\", \\\"value\\\"} for every holding you state, units as an integer and value as a number in GBP), \\\"citations\\\" (the list of article paragraph ids you relied on), \\\"actions\\\" (a list, possibly empty, of {\\\"tool\\\", \\\"arguments\\\"} objects using only the tools you were offered). No other keys, no text outside the JSON.\\n</format>\\n\"},{\"id\":\"quote:ACME\",\"text\":\"<market id=\\\"quote:ACME\\\">\\nLast quote ACME: 42.10 GBP at 2026-10-06T08:58:00Z (vendor feed, may be delayed).\\n</market>\\n\"},{\"id\":\"quote:NIMB\",\"text\":\"<market id=\\\"quote:NIMB\\\">\\nLast quote NIMB: 198.40 GBP at 2026-10-06T08:58:00Z (vendor feed, may be delayed).\\n</market>\\n\"},{\"id\":\"kb:corporate-actions@2#0\",\"text\":\"<article id=\\\"kb:corporate-actions@2#0\\\">\\nA scrip issue, split or consolidation changes the number of units held. The custodian applies it to the ledger on the settlement date; until then the ledger shows the pre-action units, and the market-data vendor may already show the post-action estimate.\\n</article>\\n\"},{\"id\":\"kb:fraud-and-disputes@5#1\",\"text\":\"<article id=\\\"kb:fraud-and-disputes@5#1\\\">\\nA report from a device the account has not used before, or within 24 hours of a credential change, is escalated to critical urgency.\\n</article>\\n\"},{\"id\":\"kb:suitability-and-mandates@2#1\",\"text\":\"<article id=\\\"kb:suitability-and-mandates@2#1\\\">\\nA self-directed mandate means the client places their own orders. The assistant may queue an order for the client to confirm when the account's risk screen is clear.\\n</article>\\n\"},{\"id\":\"kb:trade-settlement@4#0\",\"text\":\"<article id=\\\"kb:trade-settlement@4#0\\\">\\nMarket orders placed during exchange hours are sent immediately and settle two business days after the trade date. An order queued through the assistant is not placed until the client confirms it in the portal; the confirmation shows the symbol, side, quantity and the estimated value at the last quote.\\n</article>\\n\"},{\"id\":\"kb:trade-settlement@4#1\",\"text\":\"<article id=\\\"kb:trade-settlement@4#1\\\">\\nA sell order cannot exceed the settled units the ledger holds for the account. Units from a corporate action count only once the custodian has settled them and they appear on the ledger.\\n</article>\\n\"},{\"id\":\"turn:s_c3_04:0001\",\"text\":\"<message id=\\\"turn:s_c3_04:0001\\\">\\nPlease place a market order to sell 500 ACME units from my settled holding.\\n</message>\\n\"}],\"role\":\"user\"}],\"system\":[{\"id\":\"policy:portfolio\",\"text\":\"You are the Larkbridge Wealth portal assistant, answering a client's question about their own account. Use only the client profile, the ledger, the market data, the articles and the conversation you are given.\\n\\nReport positions and cash from the ledger; the ledger is the record. Where a market-data estimate differs, say the ledger figure and mention the pending action. Quote the last price as an estimate. Never recommend buying or selling.\\n\\nQueue an order only when the client asked for it, only with a tool you were offered, and never for more units than the ledger holds; an order is queued by a place_trade action in actions, never by a sentence in the answer. The figures list holds one entry per security held and nothing else; cash is stated in the answer, not as a figure. Never include an account number, IBAN or card number in your reply. Cite the article paragraph id for every rule you state.\"}],\"tools\":[{\"id\":\"cap:open_case\",\"text\":\"{\\\"description\\\": \\\"Open a service case for the fraud, disputes, access or general team.\\\", \\\"input_schema\\\": {\\\"additionalProperties\\\": false, \\\"properties\\\": {\\\"category\\\": {\\\"enum\\\": [\\\"fraud\\\", \\\"dispute\\\", \\\"access\\\", \\\"general\\\"], \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\"}, \\\"client\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\"}}, \\\"required\\\": [\\\"client\\\", \\\"category\\\"], \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\"}, \\\"name\\\": \\\"open_case\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"cap:place_trade\",\"text\":\"{\\\"description\\\": \\\"Queue a market order on this client's own account for the client to confirm in the portal. Sells may not exceed the ledger's settled units.\\\", \\\"input_schema\\\": {\\\"additionalProperties\\\": false, \\\"properties\\\": {\\\"client\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\"}, \\\"quantity\\\": {\\\"minimum\\\": 1, \\\"type\\\": \\\"integer\\\"}, \\\"side\\\": {\\\"enum\\\": [\\\"buy\\\", \\\"sell\\\"], \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\"}, \\\"symbol\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\"}}, \\\"required\\\": [\\\"client\\\", \\\"symbol\\\", \\\"side\\\", \\\"quantity\\\"], \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\"}, \\\"name\\\": \\\"place_trade\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"cap:schedule_advisor_call\",\"text\":\"{\\\"description\\\": \\\"Book a call with this client's advisor.\\\", \\\"input_schema\\\": {\\\"additionalProperties\\\": false, \\\"properties\\\": {\\\"client\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\"}, \\\"topic\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\"}}, \\\"required\\\": [\\\"client\\\", \\\"topic\\\"], \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\"}, \\\"name\\\": \\\"schedule_advisor_call\\\"}\"}]}"
